# viewport 1440x900
until 1200 ODDWATER
frames 20
key KeyJ 2
click Serve a small meal
key KeyJ 2
expect Done.
frames 2
key KeyJ 2
click Sinking pellets
click Serve a small meal
click Algae wafer
click Serve a small meal
click Goals
expect A meal at every depth
click Complete project
frames 2
expect The cutting exchange
click Care
click Equipment
click Add filter media
frames 2
expect level 2
click Plants & nursery
click Add a plant
click Add a plant
click Prepare nursery
frames 2
expect Neon tetra nursery
save progression-eggs
key KeyJ 2
click 20×
frames 1500
key ShiftLeft 2
frames 100
key KeyJ 2
expect Neon tetra nursery
expect Two juveniles are ready
click Welcome juveniles
frames 2
expect Two juveniles join the school
save progression-juveniles
click Goals
save progression-goals
